@GroundedHexagonalHost = http://localhost:5193
@DemoPlayerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@MintMaceRecipeId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### 1. Consultar inventario demo inicial
GET {{GroundedHexagonalHost}}/api/inventories/{{DemoPlayerId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Fabricar Mint Mace
POST {{GroundedHexagonalHost}}/api/crafting/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{DemoPlayerId}}",
  "recipeId": "{{MintMaceRecipeId}}"
}

###

### 3. Consultar nuevamente el inventario
GET {{GroundedHexagonalHost}}/api/inventories/{{DemoPlayerId}}
Accept: application/json

###
